    "summary": "Lead transport and logistics deal origination for DBSA, developing bankable infrastructure opportunities and building relationships with sponsors, investors and public-sector partners. The role connects sector strategy and project preparation with transaction structuring, concessional funding and execution, expanding the bank’s development-finance pipeline in South Africa and wider African markets.",
    "aboutRole": "Working with the Head of Coverage, the Principal Deal Originator shapes origination strategies and owns key client and partnership relationships. The mandate includes commercial and market analysis, project scoping and feasibility work, and coordination with preparation and transaction teams. Success is measured through pipeline quality, investment approvals, commitments and disbursements, infrastructure catalysed and development outcomes. The role also involves mentoring junior colleagues and presenting opportunities to executive committees and boards.",
